WEBVTT

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:10.880
Hey, Chino!

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.250
Cocoa?

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.080
Impressed? I can make flowers appear now!

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.540
All that daily practice has paid off.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:21.920
Shower me with more praise!

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.380
Yes, yes. You're very talented.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.880
And guess what? I've been practicing
my singing along with my magic!

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:33.000
Come be nonchalant and have a croissant~

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.210
Do we really need the singing?

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:39.920
I was just thinking that I could do what your mom did,
and help liven up the cafe!

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:44.000
Sounds like there'll be all sorts of excitement at the cafe.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.830
Oh! It might be fun for all of us
to do a jazz performance together!

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.290
Rabbit House could put on its own dinner show!

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:53.040
Then it wouldn't really be a cafe anymore, would it?

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.750
And of course, you're gonna be our vocalist!

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:56.790
Huh?!

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:59.880
Let's start practicing right now, Chino!

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:02.960
Nuh-uh! I'm not singing anymore!

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.580
A-one, a-two...!

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.500
I said I'm not singing!

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:11.880
Kuruntto hitomawari hora dance dance
Spin around with a twirl, hey, dance dance

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.960
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance dance
In the heavenly cafeteria, dance dance

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:17.630
Door wa doko? (Kocchi!)
Where is the door? (Over here!)

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:21.290
Cup no naka e pyon (Tobikonjatte!)
Take a hop into the cup (Leap right in!)

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.460
Osora ni ukabeta mokomoko na kumo
Big puffy clouds float through the sky

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.830
Jitsu wa ne amai no honto ni (uso desu!)
They actually taste sweet, for real (Just kidding!)

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:30.920
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjaeba
If we fly through the sky in tea cups and coffee cups

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:34.040
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni
We can go anywhere together

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:40.130
Itsumademo yume miteitaitte (Arieru koto yori arienai koto)
Wanting to be a dreamer forever (More impossible than possible)

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:46.210
Kangaete ashita ni tokimeite (Shiritai aji ga ippai desu)
Think about how exciting tomorrow will be (So many flavors to try!)

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.790
Sugar yori cinnamon ga
Cinnamon instead of sugar

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.670
Ki ni nari dashitara shinka no toki kamo
If that becomes a preference, it might be time for evolution

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:56.040
Atarashii basho ni (Yobareta?)
Going to a new place (Were you invited?)

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:59.080
Yobaretara omoikitte tobimashou
If you get invited there, let's take the plunge and fly

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:02.080
(Notte notte tea cup de gungun sora tobeba)
(C'mon ride in the tea cup and soar through the sky)

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.290
(Notte notte coffee cup hai hai)
(C'mon ride in the coffee cup, yeah yeah)

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:08.040
Kuruntto hitomawari hora dance dance (Dance dance!)
Spin around with a twirl, hey, dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:11.290
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance dance (Dance dance!)
In the heavenly cafeteria, dance dance (Dance dance)

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:14.960
Door wa doko? Cup no naka desu
Where is the door? It's inside of the cup

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:17.540
Mousou? Genjitsu? Docchi?
An illusion? Or reality? Which?

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:20.630
Docchidemo iinjanai kana (sokka)
It doesn't really matter either way (Good point)

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:23.920
Atama ni whip sarechatte (Fuwa fuwa)
A dollop of whip cream on your head (Fluff fluff)

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:29.750
Saa odottara (Mirai wa) kitto tanoshii kara (tonjaimasuka!)
Okay, just dance (The future) it'll definitely be fun (So let's fly!)

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.250
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjatte
Flying through the sky in tea cups and coffee cups

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.130
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni!
We can go anywhere together!

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:42.420
Welcome to Rabbit House!

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.670
Today's special is our mocha blend!

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:47.790
Playing Rabbit House waitress again?

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:50.130
You're just as into it, Mom!

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:54.420
Besides, look at what Cocoa sent us
after Christmas ended!

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:57.420
I wish she'd let me be part of all the fun!

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:00.710
She must having such a blast with all of them...

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:02.880
Isn't that a wonderful thing?

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:06.130
How does my middle school uniform look?

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:07.460
Do I seem more like an adult?

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:08.670
Yeah.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:11.250
You're also a middle schooler starting this year, huh?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:14.040
I'm gonna be just as ladylike as you, Sis!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.710
I hope I can wear the same uniform as you
in high school, too!

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:22.130
Doesn't seem like I'll ever have a chance
to strike out on my own.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:28.420
Back then, I thought that we would be together forever...

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:31.920
Enough with the gloomy look,
we have customers coming.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.830
If you're not careful, I'll write a letter to Cocoa.

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:37.210
"Mocha has become a sad lump without you around."

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.250
Don't do that!

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:42.790
I get it. I can't stay down forever.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.580
Okay!

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.710
I made some siphon coffee
just for our guests coming today.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.000
Wow! Like a true virtuoso!

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:54.210
The first cup is my present to you, Mom!

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.420
It's disgusting.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.420
What?! How could you say that!

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.500
It tastes just like mud...

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.580
You're a harsher critic than me.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:09.710
Dear, Cocoa. I hope this finds you well.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.920
Today, Mocha brewed some coffee that tasted like mu-

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.170
Mom!

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.920
You'd be a terrible influence telling her stuff like that!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.040
Suppose I better write something nice instead.

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.380
Mom...

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:27.170
That latte art Mocha made before is actually
something she learned after special training with th-

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:29.670
Why do you want to spill my secrets so badly?!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.790
This looks so yummy!

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.710
Still feeling down in the dumps?

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.080
Obviously...

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:43.710
I think you should let Cocoa see you fail every so often.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:48.170
But I always feel so pressured to set a good example...

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:51.880
Cocoa's already become
a wonderful big sister of her own.

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:55.080
Yeah, but even so...

00:04:56.670 --> 00:05:01.250
Attention, everyone! Please share with me
what you think Mocha does best!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:02.290
Be a godsister!

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:04.880
She's a master of surprises!

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:06.580
The Queen of Wheat!

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:08.460
Perhaps "Princess" is a better fit.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:11.210
Th-thank you all...

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.960
I appreciate it so much!

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:19.250
Today I'm offering you free surprise bread!

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.580
Now that's more like the Mocha I know.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:24.830
Okay! Time to try my hand at brewing again!

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.290
I can't visit Cocoa and the others until I've mastered it!

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:31.880
Those two might encourage each other
more when they're separated like this.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.210
It's ready! Take a sip, Mom!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:38.210
It's worse than before...

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:39.330
Worse than mud?!

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:46.080
We got a package from my Big Sis and family!

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:49.790
B-bad memories of all the cuddling
are coming back to me...

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.130
Senpai?!

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.000
I wonder what's inside?

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:55.790
A fresh loaf of my sister's home-baked stollen!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:01.000
And my middle school uniform that I asked her to send!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:01.880
Why?!

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:07.330
Because Chino said the other day that she was curious
what I looked like back in middle school.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.540
I never said I wanted to see your uniform!

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.290
Just like the good old days!

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:14.170
That was fast!

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:18.080
It's fabulous, Cocoa! All I'm seeing is a middle schooler!

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.630
Is that a compliment...?

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.580
Feels like I'm 13 all over again!

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.750
That would make you younger than me.

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:26.460
Huh?!

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:28.250
You're the little sister now.

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:31.880
Big Sis... Chino...

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.250
My little sister! Yes!

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.170
Her smugness level is off the charts!

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:39.880
My sister also sent her high school uniform!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:43.380
It's surprising that you didn't decide
to go to the same high school as Mocha.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.460
It wasn't an easy choice!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.880
I mean, my current school uniform is plenty cute!

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.130
Did you decide just based on the uniform...?

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:52.880
Oh, hey! How about you try this on, Chino?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:53.460
Huh?

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:58.040
It's a little big on me...

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:01.460
Mocha's high school uniform was really adorable!

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:03.380
Big Sis!

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:04.830
My sister, Chino!

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:06.380
Stop being such an annoying little sister!

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.880
The flavor of Mocha's stollen is just perfect!

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.790
I'm putting on the pounds already!

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:17.130
What are you so giddy about over there, Cocoa?!

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.170
It's a secret!

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.750
I know the truth.

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:26.500
My sister fails a lot, but she always puts in
the effort to overcome those failures.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:31.000
I've always looked up to that side of her, since forever.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.210
Okay!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:36.040
Time for me to make my own special stollen!

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:38.330
I'm gonna send it flying right back at her!

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:39.670
Change your clothes first!

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.210
Your attention please!

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:44.960
We also want to share stories
from our time in middle school!

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.000
Stop it! That's forbidden history!

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.920
What do you mean "forbidden history"?

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:52.880
Don't go prying. Even Syaro must have
some skeletons hiding in her closet.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.170
Senpai! Comments like that aren't helping!

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:56.710
Chino?

00:07:57.210 --> 00:08:00.790
I feel like I've seen these clothes somewhere before...

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.000
Look!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:06.210
I found one of your old photo albums, Mom!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.830
Didn't you go to the same high school that I did?

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:08.830
G-give that here!

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:14.040
She's never had strength like this before!

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.460
E-enough, Mom! I'll give it back!

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:19.080
L-look, I'm letting go!

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.630
MOM!

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:24.830
Here, Mom.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:26.080
Thank you.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:30.460
Jeez, you're such a klutz and an airhead.
I bet your friends had it rough.

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:33.830
My friend was the real airhead, believe me.

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:34.500
Huh?

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:41.380
She was a talented magician and singer.
We were close enough to be sisters.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.330
Oh? What was her name?

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:45.630
Usagi.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.080
Usagi?

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:51.460
A nickname. Based on her real name, Saki.

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:55.040
Usagi, huh? That's so cute!

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.420
She was.

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:59.210
But she's gone far away now.

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:03.960
Okay! Time to make preparations for dinner.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:07.920
Seriously?! I wanna see all your embarrassing pictures!

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.460
Not happening.

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.880
I ran around like such a dumdum back then.

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:21.380
I knew I had seen that uniform somewhere before.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:26.420
This means mom didn't spend
her whole life in this one town.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:33.000
Beyond here... there's a bigger world...

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:42.630
Sensei!

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:45.130
Happy New Year!

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:47.960
Yes, Happy New Year to you as well.

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:54.290
We've got plenty of time to celebrate since you finished
one of your manuscripts early for once!

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:57.080
Turns out I can get things done with some effort.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:02.210
By the way... We're on holiday now,
so why am I still getting the "Sensei" treatment?

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:07.330
W-well, it's hard for me to shift gears
because you always turn things in at the last minute!

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:08.330
So there.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:14.330
Ugh! I swear, I'm gonna drag you around
to do what I want for once!

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:15.330
Got that, Midori?

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:17.920
Great, that's what I'm here for.

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:21.170
I look forward to another wonderful year together, Rin.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.040
Hot wine really warms the soul.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.830
This is juice.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:30.330
It doesn't really feel like a new year yet, huh?

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:34.670
Are you sure you don't need to pay a visit back home?

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:38.170
Yeah! I want to stay together with you and everyone else!

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:40.790
Sounds more like visiting home is a chore for you.

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:42.040
That's not it!

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:45.420
We can only create memories
of this group while we're still together.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:49.750
Besides, being here has actually made me appreciate
the upsides of my hometown more.

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:53.580
It's honestly a shock that you've
thought about it that deeply.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:56.040
Uh, thanks? Was that supposed to be a compliment?

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:56.750
Ow!

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:57.670
Huh?

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:00.670
Uh oh! It actually hit.

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:02.380
She got a snow shower!

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:05.630
Throwing snowballs... truly the most
unruly and childish activity.

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:08.290
Sorry! It was me who threw that last one!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.630
You unruly high school senior!

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:13.040
How fun! I wanna join in!

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:14.250
Ladies!

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:17.170
We made a galette des rois to celebrate!

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:18.920
Galette des rois?

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:21.580
Whoa! It looks super yummy!

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:25.130
It's a pie shared with friends and family
at New Year's parties.

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:28.330
There's a ring hidden somewhere in the pie,
and the person who gets it in their slice

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.130
becomes king for the day!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:35.420
And the king is given the right to issue
one order that everyone else must follow!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.880
For real?!

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.330
I've heard of that!

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.210
Same here.

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:41.670
Very well, then let us begin!

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:44.210
The battle for the royal crown!

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.670
I chose this one!

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:50.080
If I end up king, then I'm making
all of you my little sisters!

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:53.920
In that case, I'll make you
and everyone else be my big sisters!

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:56.210
If I win, well...

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:59.000
Please Lord, don't let Chiya or Cocoa win.

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:01.880
I just pray we don't see the birth of a tyrant.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.880
The most selfless person usually
lucks out with stuff like this.

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:09.420
The ring was in my slice...

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:10.790
Chino?!

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.630
Congrats, Chino!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.330
The luck of the draw was with Chino today!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.460
That sounded painful, are you okay?

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.170
All hail King Chino!

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.790
Your majesty! Allow us to do your bidding!

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.380
I have to order you all right now?

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:28.880
Whatever it may be! We shall see it done!

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.500
What is thy desire?

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:32.250
U-um...

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:34.830
Er...

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:38.420
Okay, we'll break for now.

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:40.750
Everybody wants to go shopping and stuff, right?

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:41.960
Hear, hear!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:44.380
That's so you, Rize! Always with the good ideas!

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:47.130
I'm sure Chino will think up an order
before it's time to go home.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:50.710
This will give Chino a chance
to get her thoughts together first.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.040
Take your time, Chino!

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:57.170
If you want your big sister to spoil you silly,
just give the order anytime!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.460
Enough, Cocoa! Let's go!

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.880
Coming! Wait up!

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.130
Everybody left...

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:09.460
Perk up. You'll figure something out, Chino.

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:15.460
It might be a good idea for the king
to take the hopes of the citizens into consideration.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.580
The hopes of the citizens...

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:27.710
Hey, Maya, are you interested in art?

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:32.000
Looking at this painting of the ocean
started to give me an appetite for adventure!

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.790
Appetite for adventure...?

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.790
Doesn't the sea pique your curiosity?

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.670
You like building ships in a bottle, right?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.380
Well, an adventure sure does sound exciting!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:45.330
Let's get hit by a storm, be sent adrift
and then live the castaway life!

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:47.960
That's a disaster called a shipwreck!

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:52.630
Oh, hello, Chino!

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:53.880
Chiya.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.130
Check this out.

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:59.290
Wow, a store filled with beautiful lamps!

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.580
This incense is especially rare!

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:06.420
You know, incense is filled with worldly aromas
that may provide inspiration for the cafe...

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:10.000
So this is one way to get ideas, huh?

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:12.250
I sense something new on the horizon.

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:16.630
A sweet fragrance... the aroma of a delightful world...

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:19.880
Ah! That's actually the smell
of waffles from the shop next door.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.290
CAFES AROUND THE WORLD
You can't help but want to relax.
Explore the vast world of cafes!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.380
Is that a reference book, Syaro?

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.040
Uh, well... not exactly!

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:28.580
This magazine features cafes from all over the world.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.380
They're really wonderful.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:33.210
A cafe in an old castle?! And a library cafe?!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:35.670
The world sure is vast...

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:38.250
"A soothing space fueled by herbal teas."

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:40.380
Wait! That's just copying our place!

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:42.670
"A grandfather's cafe passed down generations"?

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:44.330
They're copying our cafe, too!

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:45.540
What?!

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:48.170
But we're just as appealing as them, right?

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:50.290
Of course! Probably!

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:52.290
You're right! Probably!

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:55.790
Chinooooo!

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:58.580
I can't think of what to shop for!

00:14:58.710 --> 00:14:59.960
What's the matter?

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:05.330
All the high schoolers in our group have been helping
me study, so I wanted to get them a little something...

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.290
Oh, I see.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.670
Okay then. I'll help you out.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.750
Thanks so much, Chino!

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:17.960
I've heard that it's best to reverse your train of thought
when you can't come up with any ideas.

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:21.540
Something physical... something with no form...

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.580
Like making a memory?

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:25.830
Making a memory...

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:28.670
Oh! What if we reversed that thought again?

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:31.710
Wait a second. That was already
a good idea you just had...

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:32.500
Huh?

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:38.540
What are you shopping for?

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:42.500
I was looking at some stuff that I need for
the graduation trip I'm going on with friends from school.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:44.210
Graduation trip?

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.330
You and Mame are graduating, too, right?

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.250
Aren't you going to go somewhere fun?

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.290
I never considered it.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:53.130
I'm not even sure what kind of places are good.

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:56.750
Maybe the big city, for example?

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:57.790
The big city...

00:15:57.960 --> 00:15:59.420
I've never been.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:02.170
If Chimame went to the big city... on their own...

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:04.170
Shopping! Shopping!

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:06.210
A big adventure on the subway!

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:07.920
Cafe tour!

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.790
We got shipwrecked.

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:12.880
YOU CANNOT GO ON YOUR OWN!

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:14.920
What exactly did you just imagine?!

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:21.250
So... what are you doing out here?

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:22.920
Cocoa...

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:25.290
I wanted to try being buried in the snow!

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:28.380
Your boundless enthusiasm is to be admired, somewhat.

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.880
I'm sure getting a lot of compliments today!

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:36.790
Looking up at the sky makes me feel
like I'm connected to home.

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:43.710
Seeing the outside world
makes you appreciate your hometown more...

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:46.330
I smell curry in the air!

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:47.130
Huh?

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:49.750
And this isn't any ordinary curry!

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:52.540
I'm picking up on the touch
of an expert just from the smell!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.250
I am feeling hungry.

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.580
Let's go find it!

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.250
It might give me a hint on the development
of my new curry bread!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.880
You never change, do you?

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:11.960
Hurry, Chino!

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:15.830
Ah! Slow down, Cocoa!

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:21.830
It's a pain in the ass, to be honest.

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:23.380
Oh, come on.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:26.170
I've got high expectations for your performance.

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:28.040
Really now?

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:31.880
Your attitude may be third-rate, but your skill is pro-level.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.960
Plus, there's no one else who can do it.

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:39.710
Hey, you're never gonna be a proper adult
if you keep putting up a front like that.

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:42.670
I could say the exact same to you.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:47.330
I'll have you know, I've become
a little more honest thanks to Rize.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:50.330
Even on the battlefield, you've always been like that.

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.420
Thanks, man.

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.250
Huh? What?

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:54.830
Where's this honesty suddenly coming from?

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:02.080
Anyway, we're going to be playing a new song.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.040
Make sure to get some practice in.

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:09.000
Don't gotta tell me. I'll let you hear
my heavenly performance soon enough.

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.330
Great. Let's make it the best show we've ever done.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.040
I've made up my mind.

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:18.080
I shall now give you my order as king.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:24.790
If Rize passes her test, I'd like to celebrate
her entrance to college by combining it

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.380
with a graduation trip for the Chimame Corps.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.460
I want to explore the outside world with you all.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:33.000
This is my order as your king.

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:36.040
Huh?! It's not to make us your big sisters?!

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.130
That's just a proposal, not an order!

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:40.040
Y-you think so?

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.080
I'm in full agreement with the idea.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.290
But you'll have to come up with a real order to give later.

00:18:44.460 --> 00:18:45.790
Ehhh...?

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:48.330
We need to focus on studying for our exams right now.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:50.380
Let's give it 100%, Rize!

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:54.460
Uh, actually, I missed my chance to bring this up earlier...

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:57.130
but I passed the entrance exam to university already.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.330
What?!

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:01.540
H-hey!

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:02.710
Way to keep us in the dark!

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:04.170
This is payback for earlier!

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:07.290
Hey! This is worst celebration ever!

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:09.080
You were working hard in secret, huh?

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:11.080
Congratulations, Senpai!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.540
Cut it out!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:17.040
Rize!

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:18.500
Congrats!

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.420
Thanks!

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:26.380
Senpai! Where do you want to go to celebrate?

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.540
How about we take a trip to a hot springs?

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:32.630
I wanna go to the beach! C'mon, Rize!
Let's check out the ocean!

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:36.380
The big city would be nice.
It's not scary if we all go together!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:40.130
Okay, okay. Let's all think it over and decide together.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.500
Yay!

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:44.880
We're gonna have an all-night brainstorm party
at Rabbit House!

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:45.420
What?!

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:46.710
Woo-hoo!

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:47.420
Sounds great!

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:49.710
Why does Cocoa get to decide everything?

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:52.830
How wonderful! You want to come, don't you, Syaro?

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:55.420
Well, I'd love to if I could...

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:58.330
Chino, do you mind if we all spend the night?

00:19:58.920 --> 00:19:59.750
Wait.

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:03.380
This is... my official order to you...

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:07.790
Come to my house right now and hang out all night long!

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:11.290
Hooray!

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:15.670
Okay, Chino! That means we're having a race
to get back to Rabbit House!

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:17.830
Ready... go!

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:22.080
First place is mine!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:23.920
Only if you can catch me!

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.630
Hold it!

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.380
C'mon, hurry up!

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:29.670
Chino! Let's move!

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:32.670
P-please wait up!

00:21:54.670 --> 00:21:58.790
Never in my wildest dreams would I have
expected you to give an order like that!

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:02.000
It even came as a surprise to me, actually.

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:05.170
I think it must be because of your weird influence on me.

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:09.000
B-but I was really happy about it, you know!

00:22:09.170 --> 00:22:15.130
Well, the reality hasn't hit me just yet.
Plus I'm a little scared of exploring a new world.

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:16.880
That's natural.

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:23.000
But I feel motivated to see new horizons
alongside everyone else.

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:24.960
Chino...

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:28.880
D-do you think this is also your weird influence?

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.290
Probably!

00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:36.330
Rize, Chiya, Syaro, Maya, and Megu...

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:41.460
I've realized that hanging out with them is fun
because of all the new things I discover.

00:22:42.080 --> 00:22:42.920
And so...

00:22:43.330 --> 00:22:44.960
Right! I feel the same!

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:52.630
As long as we're together, any place on Earth
is fun to be. There's no doubt!

00:22:54.920 --> 00:22:56.920
That's enough about that.

00:22:56.920 --> 00:22:58.130
It's time to go home.

00:22:58.130 --> 00:23:01.210
Ah, wait! I'm gonna make a note on my calendar!

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:05.630
Good grief. You seriously never change.

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:10.330
But it was thanks to you that I got to know everyone...

00:23:10.330 --> 00:23:11.330
It's done!

00:23:11.880 --> 00:23:14.500
I marked today to commemorate your new step forward!

00:23:15.210 --> 00:23:16.250
Cocoa...

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:21.790
While I'm still in this weird mood,
I've got something I'd like to say to you.

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:24.170
But don't read too much into it.

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:25.380
Huh?

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:27.630
Um...

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:30.710
Thank you very much.

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:36.040
Bunnisode 12:
I Can Take That Step Forward
Because You Are Watching

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:32.630
Cocoa!
